   "zh": "双膝一起慢慢左右倒，肩膀贴地"
  },
  "point.o-seated-fig4": {
   "en": "Ankle on the knee, keep the back straight and lean forward",
   "zh": "脚踝搭在膝盖上，背挺直往前压"
  },
  "point.o-seated-ham": {
